==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Legends Awakened|Misdreavus|107}} from the {{TCG|Legends Awakened}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Misdreavus}}.
*'''Mumble''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Whismur|94}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

